{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Account for the anchor sampling window**\n\nA scheduler pause between these reads permanently shifts this invocation's SDK clock behind ordinary user spans by the pause duration. A short user span can then end after its operation or invocation parent; the new test allows 1 ms but never stalls between the reads. Retain monotonic bracket endpoints and use conservative lower-bound starts and upper-bound ends, then add a forced-stall containment test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs77JjVu","finding_digest":"eb83580fb6c6151f56b816d070253ecd2eea42747ad77dfe9353b102e28878f5","finding_id":"arf_v1_5obvqd5wyykr6vvyc3ihajj6zu","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-clock.ts::captureinvocationclock::stalled-sample-containment","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-clock.ts::captureinvocationclock::stalled-sample-containment","line":13,"observation_digest":"868c2dee1ec9708b288e2e99217e5c2b56b2908a8af43422ac3ec9fb8c1982e8","observation_id":"aro_v1_q2gc33q6zfyiwkeof2msc7s4fn","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-clock.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_5obvqd5wyykr6vvyc3ihajj6zu","published_at":"2026-10-08T01:03:55Z","review_id":"arr_v1_wofuyp74kqn6ok2mvsxduqo3dw","reviewed_base_sha":"19ee19fa0619093943f079b69943f7b5cdee7ac7","reviewed_head_sha":"a234d85da3e7b49fcfb1ce720392d27585cd0d8c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":12,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":962},"record_id":"art_v1_6lz5d4my2wjnusjuezk7fp4qmr","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T01:03:55Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
